Lyra - third-party UI attribution
==================================

Portions of the user interface are adapted from:

  MeloX-Android
  https://github.com/lladlam/MeloX-Android
  Reference commit: 4af356f
  License: GNU General Public License v3.0

  The adapted portions are limited to visual layout, interaction and design
  tokens. MeloX-Android's music providers, account system, synchronization,
  plugin runtime and other data-layer code are not included.

Liquid glass components are built on:

  Kyant0/AndroidLiquidGlass
  https://github.com/Kyant0/AndroidLiquidGlass
  License: Apache License 2.0
  Libraries: io.github.kyant0:backdrop, shapes, capsule

Fonts:

  This project does not include Apple's SF Pro font. The reference project
  uses SF Pro only for SF Symbols glyphs and explicitly excludes it from its
  GPLv3 grant. Lyra maps the same icon names to Material Symbols instead.
